The native FreeBSD NVIDIA System Management Interface and Management Library,
paired with the matching NVIDIA kernel modules. This headless subset installs
no X server, OpenGL/EGL provider, libmap override, Linux compatibility library,
service, driver-loading configuration, or jail device rule.

This package enables explicit driver attachment and telemetry validation. It
does not provide CUDA, NVENC, rendering, or a shared-jail acceleration contract.
